nk\" aria-label=\"Earn 3X Miles with SIXT\">Earn 3X Miles with SIXT</a></span><!----></span></div><!----></nav></div></div><!----></div></app-jss-breadcrumbs><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-about-special-offers class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"about-special-offer-wrapper\"><div class=\"main-content\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"about-offer-banner\"><h1 class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Earn 3X Miles with SIXT</h1><!----><h3 class=\"ng-star-inserted\"></h3><!----><div class=\"about-offer-banner-img\"><img src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Alfursan/2025/2/sixt-1920x461.ashx?h=461&amp;iar=0&amp;w=1920&amp;rev=5583d66ffb43455cb7bcb4f6680246e6&amp;hash=E284F025D6DE264F03737C76F47FF5BC\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----></div></div><div class=\"about-offer-button\"><button mat-button=\"\" class=\"mat-focus-indicator button mat-button mat-button-base\"><span class=\"mat-button-wrapper\"><a href=\"http://www.sixt.com/saudia\" linktype=\"external\" url=\"http://www.sixt.com/saudia\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Book now!</span><!----><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined learn-more-icon\">call_made</span></a><!----></span><span matripple=\"\" class=\"mat-ripple mat-button-ripple\"></span><span class=\"mat-button-focus-overlay\"></span></button><div class=\"mobileExpireNote\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">event</span><span>Valid until 30 Sep 2026</span></div></div><div class=\"section-wrapper\"><div id=\"page\" class=\"about-offer-content\"><div id=\"menuleftcontent\" class=\"menu-left-content\"><ul id=\"menu\"><li class=\"active ng-star-inserted\"><a><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">About the offer</span><!----><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined ng-star-inserted\">chevron_right</span><!----></a></li><!----><li class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><a><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Terms &amp; Conditions</span><!----><!----></a></li><!----><!----></ul></div><div class=\"right-content\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"special-offer-rte\">\n<div id=\"#abouttheoffer\">\n<div class=\"section-heading\">\n<h2>About the offer</h2>\n<span class=\"expire-note\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">event</span>Valid until\n30 Sep 2026</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section-content\">\n<p>Celebrate National Day with bigger rewards every time you drive with SIXT. Rent a car for 3 days or more and earn 3x more AlFursan Miles, with a total of 1,500 Miles per eligible rental, bringing you closer to more trips and rewards.</p>\n<p>With SIXT’s global network and premium fleet, enjoy a seamless rental experience designed to elevate every journey.</p>\n\n<h3>Offer Validity:</h3>\n<p>Booking period: until 30 September 2026</p>\n<p>Rental period: 15 September – 31 December 2026</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div id=\"#termsandconditions\">\n<div class=\"section-heading\">\n<h2>Terms and Conditions</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section-content\">\n<ul class=\"my-custom-list\">\n<li>Booking period: 15.09.2026–30.09.2026. Rental period: 15.09.2026–31.12.2026.</li>\n<li>Minimum rental length: 3 days. Maximum rental length: 27 days.</li>\n<li>The following rentals are excluded from mileage promotions: van/truck rentals, insurance replacement rentals, long-term rentals (28+ days), rentals with vouchers, prepaid “Pay Now” rentals, rentals below €25 (or local equivalent), partner-company rentals (e.g., ADAC), and certain corporate rates.</li>\n<li>Mileage credits are awarded per rental and can be claimed retroactively up to 6 months if the promotion was valid at booking and rental time.</li>\n<li>Mileage credit is only possible if the rental contract is under the AlFursan member’s name.</li>\n<li>General SIXT terms and conditions apply.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div></span><!----></div></div></div></div></div><div></div></div></app-jss-about-special-offers><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container-fluid\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-special-offers class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"special-offers-wrapper similar-offers-wrapper\"><div class=\"main-content\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-wrapper\"><div class=\"special-offer-heading\"><h2 class=\"ng-star-inserted\">More offers for you</h2><!----><!----></div><!----><div class=\"offer-card-wrap ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div></div></div></app-jss-special-offers><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><!----></sc-placeholder>"}